cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite as below."
title: "LSTM with Hybrid Student-t Loss for Volatility Forecasting: Replication Repository"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2025-08-01"
abstract: >
  This repository contains the code and data for hybrid Student-t loss
  for LSTM volatility forecasting. The repository includes ARCH/GARCH benchmarks,
  ML/DL benchmarks, the proposed LSTM-SSE-t-Student model, and full
  OOS evaluation with DM tests, MCS, and VaR/ES backtests across four
  financial series (BTC-USD, ETH-USD, DJIA, S&P 500).
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/placeholder/arch-lstm-hybrid-loss"
keywords:
  - volatility forecasting
  - LSTM
  - Student-t loss
  - GARCH
  - Model Confidence Set
  - Diebold-Mariano
